// Text containment of an Array<String> formal whose body may return or write
// String. Its element text stays in the callee frame when every text source
// -- an element of the formal or of a contained local array, or a contained
// String local -- is read by a primitive or borrowed consumer or a
// borrow-only String formal, initializes or overwrites a String local, or
// enters `ArrayPush` of a local Array<String> that starts empty and is only
// pushed, measured and indexed. No such text reaches the result, a writable
// formal or retained storage; any other use keeps the formal fail-closed.

import "ast_string_formal_local_text_containment_owner.pgy";
import "ast_string_formal_source_text_containment_owner.pgy";
